# Probe replay: MISSION/MISSIONS and the HTML viewer end to end in the real binary.
# Boot -> Probe world -> new soul -> map 0 link 0 is the "Gateway of Dreams" (scene 3), whose
# script arms the Missions button with `MISSIONS 1,2,3` (opcode 0x4A) and then suspends in
# `HTML probe.htm` (opcode 0x29, scene state 10).
expect boot_menu 900
# FUN_00402A73's Terms of Service modal opens on entry to the main menu (front.c:534
# tos_gate, consumed at front.c:770) and swallows the next key. "I Accept" is
# tos_accept = (356,371,75,23), so its centre is (393,382). This replay runs against
# tests/probeworld, which ships no tos.rtf, so tos_gate() returns 1 and the modal never
# opens - hence the click with no `expect tos_accept` (tos_prompt is simply absent).
click 393 382
# State 2 is where FUN_0041F699 makes its synchronous 0x46F call, which raises
# SRNet's modal (0x42AA10). 1005 "Solo Game" is (250,313,299,23) -> centre
# (399,324); control 1 "Play Game" is (250,380,75,23) -> centre (287,391).
# 1005 then 1 closes it, 0x46F returns 1, FUN_0041D374 registers
# "--- Scanning ---", and the stepper FUN_00438E8E runs ~30 calls (6140 to
# 8340 ms) before FUN_0041B891(3) draws the world list.
click 399 324
wait 10
click 630 309
wait 240
# State 3 is the world list; RETURN takes the highlighted row
# (msg 0x474), which is the keyboard shortcut for the row's click.
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text Probe
key RETURN
# The New Soul chain (NewSoulOnOK 0x460A7E, dialog 149, dialog 180): PK review Yes,
# ability points OK, apply the rest randomly Yes, Use This Skin.
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
wait 2
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 600
expect map_enter 900
# Incarnate's "Place Yourself On Gaiea!" Sage box is modal over the map: answer No.
key n
wait 2
keydown DOWN
expect scene_enter 1500
keyup DOWN
expect missions_offer 400
expect scene_op 400
# the HTML page is open now: screenshot it, follow the link, screenshot, then close it
expect html_open 200
wait 10
shot /home/jshield/src/games/WoS/work/shots/wos-probe-html.bmp
wait 10
click 60 36
expect html_link 120
wait 10
shot /home/jshield/src/games/WoS/work/shots/wos-probe-html2.bmp
wait 10
key ESCAPE
expect html_close 200
# the Missions button: FUN_004787B2 slot 6 -> {589-51*6, 8, 48, 48} = {283,8,48,48}
click 300 30
expect missions_panel 300
wait 10
shot /home/jshield/src/games/WoS/work/shots/wos-probe-missions.bmp
wait 10
# ENTER is the action button (id 1): accept Jelly Bellies -> Status 1 in the hero's .mis
key RETURN
expect mission_status 200
expect mission_accept 200
wait 10
shot /home/jshield/src/games/WoS/work/shots/wos-probe-accepted.bmp
quit
